<!-- About Brother Aaron -->
<section class="content-section" id="brother-aaron" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>About Brother Aaron</h2>

        <p class="about-byline">
            <strong class="text-gold">Brother Aaron Powner</strong> &mdash; Ministering Elder &middot; Chief Author, <em>Words of Plainness</em>
        </p>

        <div class="narr-entry" hidden>
            <button type="button" class="narr-entry__btn" id="narrEntry"
                data-video-desktop="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.media.video_desktop }}"
                data-video-mobile="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.media.video_mobile }}"
                data-audio="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.media.audio }}"
                data-poster="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.media.poster_video }}"
                data-vtt="/about/narration.vtt"
                data-duration="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.duration }}">
                <img class="narr-entry__face" src="{{ about_narration_timing.meta.media.poster }}" alt="" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                <span class="narr-entry__text">
                    <span class="narr-entry__label">Hear it from me</span>
                    <span class="narr-entry__sub">Brother Aaron reads this page &middot; about 8 minutes</span>
                </span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <img
            src="/assets/images/aaron-collage.png"
            alt="Collage of Brother Aaron - teaching, traveling, and ministry moments"
            class="about-collage"
            id="aboutCollageImage"
        >

        <p>
            {% narr "bio-p1-s1" %}Welcome, welcome!{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p1-s2" %}I'm Brother Aaron, and I'm the Ministering Elder and Chief Author of
            Words of Plainness.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p1-s3" %}Before entering full-time ministry, I spent twenty-six years in the
            classroom teaching science to young people&mdash;helping them
            understand the natural world and discover the joy of asking good questions.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p1-s4" %}Now,
            in what some might call retirement, I've found that the questions I most want to
            explore are the ones science alone can't answer.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            {% narr "bio-p2-s1" %}I'm an ordained Elder in the Melchizedek Priesthood of The Church of Jesus Christ
            of Latter-day Saints.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p2-s2" %}My faith was shaped by years of study, service, and a mission
            to Argentina that changed how I see the world.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p2-s3" %}But this ministry isn't about
            promoting one denomination over another&mdash;it's about Jesus Christ and the common
            ground shared by all who seek Him.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            {% narr "bio-p3-s1" %}Within this ministry I carry the title of Ministering Elder.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p3-s2" %}I hold it not as a
            rank but as a description of the work itself&mdash;to minister, in the plain and
            ongoing sense of that word, to whoever God sets in my path.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p3-s3" %}When it comes to the
            writings gathered here, I answer to a second title: Chief Author.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p3-s4" %}My brother Jim
            labors beside me, and the heart of this work is shared between us; but the governing
            pen, and the accountability that comes with holding it, rests with me.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p3-s5" %}For more
            information, feel free to read the
            <a href="/chapters/01-introduction/" class="text-gold">first chapter of my writings</a>.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            {% narr "bio-p4-s1" %}Today, my wife and I travel in our RV, meeting people wherever we go.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p4-s2" %}I host
            interfaith discussions in VR Chat, create music as part of the Powner Method,
            and write with the goal of making deep truths accessible.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "bio-p4-s3" %}If you ever cross paths
            with a bald, bearded fellow talking about faith in a coffee shop or campground,
            it might be me.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <figure class="about-figure" id="throwback-collage">
            <picture>
                <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/throwback-collage-mobile.webp" width="800" height="707">
                <img
                    src="/assets/images/throwback-collage.webp"
                    width="1080" height="954"
                    loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                    class="about-figure__image js-lightbox-trigger"
                    alt="Six real photographs of Brother Aaron Powner, labeled by age: at 2 years old, 8 years old and 22 years old; teaching a science class in his late 30s; in his late 40s; and approaching 60, with a full white beard."
                >
            </picture>
            <figcaption>
                {% narr "collage-cap" %}Every face here is a real photograph of me, from my earliest years to today. Three of those ages sing together in the joyful Indie Folk arrangement of “<a href="/music/#watch=one-voice-one-mind" target="_blank" rel="noopener">One Voice, One Mind</a>.”{% endnarr %}
            </figcaption>
        </figure>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Ministry Philosophy -->
<section class="content-section alt" id="philosophy" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>{% narr "phil-h" %}Ministry Philosophy{% endnarr %}</h2>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "phil-p1-t" %}Christ-Centered, Not Tribal.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "phil-p1-s1" %}I use the phrase "Christ-centered" rather than "Christian" deliberately.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "phil-p1-s2" %}The word "Christian" has become, for many, a tribal marker&mdash;a way of asking
            "are you one of us?"{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "phil-p1-s3" %}I want to point to the person of Jesus Christ rather
            than to any institution's claim on Him.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "phil-p2-t" %}Plainness Over Complexity.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "phil-p2-s1" %}The name "Words of Plainness" comes from {% scripture "2 Nephi 31:3" %}&mdash;the idea that God speaks
            to His children in language they can understand.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "phil-p2-s2" %}I believe truth is best served
            by clarity, not obscured by unnecessary complexity.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "phil-p3-t" %}Faith Expressed in Living.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "phil-p3-s1" %}I believe discipleship flows naturally from love&mdash;not as a transaction to earn
            salvation, but as the heart's natural response to grace.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "phil-p3-s2" %}"If ye love me, keep
            my commandments" frames obedience as love's expression, not a checkbox requirement.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "phil-p4-t" %}Bridges, Not Walls.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "phil-p4-s1" %}Believers across traditions have more in common than the things that separate us.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "phil-p4-s2" %}This ministry exists to explore that common ground without pretending our
            differences don't exist.{% endnarr %}
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- How This Work Is Made (formerly AI Disclosure; #ai-disclosure kept for footer links) -->
<section class="content-section" id="ai-disclosure" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2 id="how-this-is-made">{% narr "how-h" %}How This Work Is Made{% endnarr %}</h2>

        <p>
            {% narr "how-p1-s1" %}If you have wondered whether a human being stands behind these words, I honor the
            question.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p1-s2" %}You should ask it.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p1-s3" %}We live in a day when a machine can produce fluent
            paragraphs about God without knowing Him, and a reader who demands to know who is
            speaking — and whether the speaker believes what he says — is exercising exactly the
            discernment the scriptures require of us: "Prove all things; hold fast that which is
            good" ({% scripture "1 Thessalonians 5:21" %}).{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p1-s4" %}So let me answer plainly.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "how-p2-t" %}The witness is mine.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "how-p2-s1" %}I spent twenty-six years teaching science before giving myself to this ministry full
            time.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p2-s2" %}I served the Lord as a missionary in Argentina as a young man, and I serve now as
            an ordained Elder in the Melchizedek Priesthood of The Church of Jesus Christ of
            Latter-day Saints.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p2-s3" %}The theology in these pages, the convictions, the questions, the
            personal reflections, and the testimony that anchors them — these are my own.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p2-s4" %}I learned
            for myself, on my knees, that God lives and that Jesus is my living Savior and Redeemer,
            and everything published here flows from that witness.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p2-s5" %}No machine wrote it, because no
            machine has it.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "how-p3-t" %}Scribes and servants.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "how-p3-s1" %}The Lord's word has always passed through helping hands.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p3-s2" %}Paul dictated his epistle to
            the Romans through a scribe named Tertius ({% scripture "Romans 16:22" %}), yet no one
            doubts whose testimony the epistle carries.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p3-s3" %}Prophets and apostles have worked through
            scribes, translators, and editors in every age.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p3-s4" %}The question that matters is not whose
            hand held the pen but whose witness the words bear — and who answers to God for them.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p3-s5" %}Here, that is me.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p3-s6" %}I hold the governing pen, and I hold the accountability.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "how-p4-t" %}The tools I use.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "how-p4-s1" %}Everything in these Words of Plainness is genuinely human: the gospel principles, the
            witness, and the inspiration come from a lifetime of my own prayer, study, and spiritual
            experience, and the final word on every line is mine.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p4-s2" %}I openly use modern AI tools to
            fill gaps in my skills and to check my work: Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT and others for
            editing, research, refining, and website code; ElevenLabs, Suno and others in my music
            and narration workflow; OpenArt and related tools for imagery.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p4-s3" %}Some voices, music and
            images you encounter here are generated by those tools under my direction.
            <a href="/about/under-the-hood/" class="text-gold"><em>Under the Hood</em></a> lists every
            tool and what it does.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p4-s4" %}These tools serve me the way a level serves a mason — the wall is still the
            mason's work.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p4-s5" %}I have also built my writing process so that these tools learn to follow
            <em>my</em> voice, drawn from decades of my own writing, and not the other way around.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <figure class="about-figure" id="rv-workspace">
            <picture>
                <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/rv-workspace-mobile.webp" width="940" height="529">
                <img
                    src="/assets/images/rv-workspace.webp"
                    width="1672" height="941"
                    loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                    class="about-figure__image js-lightbox-trigger"
                    alt="Brother Aaron's workspace in his RV: an empty office chair before a desk with a monitor, keyboard and microphone; a television above an electric fireplace shows a painting of Christ teaching; a window looks onto trees and parked trailers, with a garland of lights overhead and a small kitchen counter and sink at right."
                >
            </picture>
            <figcaption>
                {% narr "workspace-cap" %}My workspace in our RV, from a real photograph tidied up with AI and Photoshop.{% endnarr %}
            </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "how-p5-t" %}What these tools never do.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "how-p5-s1" %}They do not originate doctrine.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p5-s2" %}They do not write my testimony.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p5-s3" %}They do not publish
            anything.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p5-s4" %}Every AI-assisted draft is painstakingly mediated — and sometimes remediated —
            and verified against authoritative sources before I approve it.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p5-s5" %}If a page carries my
            name, I have read every word of it and I answer for every word of it.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            {% narr "how-p6-s1" %}The discipleship web apps and the main website are designed to support your own
            studies, not replace your personal engagement with the text.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong class="text-gold">{% narr "how-p7-t" %}Prove all things.{% endnarr %}</strong>
            {% narr "how-p7-s1" %}If anything I have published reads untrue to you,
            <a href="/connect/#contact" class="text-gold">write to me</a> and show me where.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p7-s2" %}I will
            answer for it — that is a promise I make as the author, not a policy written by a
            committee.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p7-s3" %}And when you have proven the words, I invite you to do what Philip invited
            Nathanael to do: "Come and see" ({% scripture "John 1:46" %}).{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p7-s4" %}The words are only the
            lantern.{% endnarr %}
            {% narr "how-p7-s5" %}What they point to is Christ.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <aside class="about-uth-callout">
            <p>
                {% narr "how-p8-s1" %}Curious to read a more detailed account of how the content is developed and how the website architecture itself was built?{% endnarr %}
                {% narr "how-p8-s2" %}Read
                <a href="/about/under-the-hood/" class="text-gold">Under the Hood</a>, a plain account of the people, tools, hosting and checks behind these pages.{% endnarr %}
            </p>
        </aside>

        <p class="about-prayer">
            {% narr "how-p9-s1" %}My prayer is that what you find here will authentically draw you closer to God and bless your life.{% endnarr %}
        </p>

        <!-- TEMPORARY (SITE step 11) - to be retired or re-pointed when the /music/ "Psalms of Brother Aaron" section goes live (MUSIC step 18). -->
